# CR 616.1: Phyrexian Metamorph entering beside Essence of the Wild has two
# copy replacements, and its controller picks which applies first. Candidates
# are listed own first, then the watcher: index 0 is Metamorph's own. It
# copies the opponent's Ichor Wellspring and so is no longer a creature, which
# leaves Essence's "each other creature you control" with nothing to apply to
# on the re-gather. The copied "when this enters, draw a card" is what tells
# the two orders apart: only here does the controller draw. The {U/P} is paid
# with 2 life.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue payphyrexian false
queue replacement 0
queue confirmeffect true
queue cardchoice 8
castspell human 1
resolvestack
